        "id": 5395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-24T18:52:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, so drop the estimateMaxAllocation and just go with fMaxAllocation? I\u0027m not quite sure how feasible it is to have a super accurate cumulative memory usage if we are keeping track of allocations and frees, but if we just track allocations, that shouldn\u0027t be too hard.",
      "parentUuid": "c42743fa_502a957c",
      "revId": "6afce35691bc547cd276eab7ae2b34595c282683",
